WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.900
World Masterpiece Theater

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
Homeless Child Remy

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
"About Love"

00:15.260 --> 00:23.200
I continue wishing to see you

00:23.690 --> 00:28.360
Today we'll go on a journey

00:28.450 --> 00:32.310
That's as endless as the blue sky

00:32.820 --> 00:40.990
With joy, sorrow and hope come setbacks

00:41.360 --> 00:46.040
They repeat, they repeat

00:46.280 --> 00:50.870
What should I believe?

00:51.510 --> 00:59.880
You know nothing about love, however

01:00.320 --> 01:08.900
Someday you will feel warmth inside

01:09.730 --> 01:19.860
I dream of the day when you'll speak of love

01:20.860 --> 01:28.660
Tomorrow, our journey will begin

01:29.510 --> 01:35.000
Presented by:
Takara Fansubs & Migoto

01:35.020 --> 01:39.380
Episode 15:
New Friends

02:05.240 --> 02:07.390
That's right... I was...

02:08.900 --> 02:11.690
Hey! How long are you gonna sleep?

02:14.920 --> 02:19.440
If you want to stay in this house, you'll have to work hard.

02:20.940 --> 02:23.190
What can you do anyways?

02:23.800 --> 02:27.970
In Mr. Vitalis' troupe, I played instruments and sang songs.

02:27.970 --> 02:31.490
And I did a play with Capi and Joli-Coeur.

02:32.470 --> 02:34.450
Songs and plays... I see...

02:36.500 --> 02:38.700
You can make money doing that for a while.

02:39.100 --> 02:43.960
The dog and monkey need to be fed too, so bring in at least 20 sous.

02:46.100 --> 02:46.800
But...

02:46.800 --> 02:47.650
Understand?

02:54.730 --> 02:56.450
If you understand then go.

02:56.450 --> 02:58.630
Everyone else has already left.

03:19.670 --> 03:20.370
Be careful.

03:20.370 --> 03:21.400
Sorry.

03:24.190 --> 03:27.460
Flowers, flowers...
Would anyone like some flowers?

03:27.940 --> 03:30.230
Would you like some beautiful flowers?

03:31.240 --> 03:33.550
Don't waste your time.

03:33.550 --> 03:34.610
Lise...

03:34.610 --> 03:35.750
Are you going off to work?

03:35.750 --> 03:39.860
Yeah. I'm going to perform with Capi and Joli-Coeur.

03:39.860 --> 03:42.810
Huh? You're selling flowers, Lise?

03:43.740 --> 03:44.670
Yup.

03:44.670 --> 03:47.270
What about the rest of you?
What kind of work do they do?

03:47.530 --> 03:51.420
The smaller boys sell newspapers or polish shoes.

03:51.420 --> 03:54.490
The girls sell flowers or other things like that.

03:55.090 --> 03:58.390
Hmm... What about Mattia and Ricardo?

04:00.060 --> 04:03.860
Ah... Well... You'll find out eventually...

04:10.490 --> 04:15.700
Well, I'm going to the market area. Remy, you can go to the plaza over there.

04:15.700 --> 04:18.260
There's a lot of people from foreign countries there.

04:18.530 --> 04:21.370
I see. Then I'll go there.

04:21.370 --> 04:22.270
Thank you, Lise.

04:22.890 --> 04:23.800
Remy!

04:25.520 --> 04:28.050
You have to be careful around other kids.

04:28.050 --> 04:29.210
Other kids?

04:29.700 --> 04:32.530
In Paris, there are many kids like us.

04:32.810 --> 04:37.270
If you are seen by bigger kids, your money will get taken away.

04:37.270 --> 04:39.390
I understand. Thank you.

04:53.770 --> 04:56.450
Hello, people of Paris!

04:56.450 --> 04:58.600
This is the Vitalis Troupe's fun...

05:00.890 --> 05:03.820
This isn't Vitalis' troupe anymore.

05:03.820 --> 05:06.010
If Mr. Vitalis were alive...

05:16.180 --> 05:17.990
Joli-Coeur... Capi...

05:19.310 --> 05:21.450
That's right... I'm sorry.

05:24.550 --> 05:27.370
Hello, people of Paris!

05:27.370 --> 05:31.670
Now the Vitalis troupe's fun show will begin...

05:39.580 --> 05:41.720
Look! There's 32 sous.

05:43.090 --> 05:44.460
I'm so glad.

05:45.550 --> 05:50.430
No... We can't buy anything. We have to give it to Mr. Gaspard.

05:50.430 --> 05:51.480
Hey...

05:51.980 --> 05:53.940
That looks nice.

05:53.940 --> 05:55.630
Hand it over.

05:56.020 --> 05:57.490
No! It's...

06:05.430 --> 06:07.620
Give it back! That money's important!

06:22.010 --> 06:23.210
Capi... Can you?

06:39.660 --> 06:42.730
You're right, Joli-Coeur.
Let's go somewhere else.

06:47.560 --> 06:48.580
Ricardo!

06:54.790 --> 06:56.410
What are you trying to do? Bastard!

07:00.060 --> 07:01.150
Ricardo...

07:09.570 --> 07:13.270
Ah... Well... You'll find out eventually...

07:23.960 --> 07:27.200
Shut up, I said.

07:47.450 --> 07:49.100
You're late.

07:49.470 --> 07:50.510
Sorry.

07:50.510 --> 07:51.730
Come here.

07:51.730 --> 07:52.450
Yes, sir.

07:59.630 --> 08:02.420
Did you earn the money as you promised?

08:02.420 --> 08:03.510
Well...

08:03.510 --> 08:05.090
Did you earn the money?

08:06.360 --> 08:11.620
My money was snatched away by some boys I didn't know.

08:12.710 --> 08:14.710
Who will believe such an excuse?

08:20.990 --> 08:23.010
I'm all right, Capi. I'm all right.

08:23.760 --> 08:27.510
You know what happens to those who don't earn their keep.

08:32.770 --> 08:33.750
Lise!

08:36.040 --> 08:39.010
I'm sorry... I couldn't make any sales at all.

08:40.020 --> 08:41.200
What?

08:43.730 --> 08:46.150
Were you playing around all day long, too?!

08:46.150 --> 08:50.390
I wasn't playing. I was walking around the city until now.

08:50.390 --> 08:51.240
Shut up!

08:55.120 --> 08:58.500
Listen, those who were playing around will get no food!

08:58.500 --> 09:00.380
The only thing you will be given is this!

09:00.940 --> 09:02.630
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

09:10.560 --> 09:15.190
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
I will sell them all tomorrow!

09:15.190 --> 09:16.140
Shut up!

09:19.350 --> 09:20.370
Stop!

09:20.370 --> 09:21.070
Move!

09:22.000 --> 09:25.610
I wasn't playing around. I did my best.

09:26.120 --> 09:27.720
And so did Lise.

09:27.720 --> 09:29.150
What did you say?

09:29.150 --> 09:32.960
Mr. Vitalis told me that no matter how hard you work,

09:32.960 --> 09:35.250
sometimes no audience will come to you.

09:35.250 --> 09:37.830
It's not your fault when that happens.

09:38.150 --> 09:40.120
You can do your best tomorrow.

09:40.120 --> 09:41.840
Selling flowers is the same way.

09:42.250 --> 09:46.800
Even though you try very hard to sell them, there may be no customers...

09:46.800 --> 09:48.840
Stop making excuses!

09:51.450 --> 09:54.120
Seems like you need this too.

09:54.120 --> 09:55.220
Stop this violence!

09:55.220 --> 09:56.730
What are you doing?! Get off of me!

09:56.730 --> 10:00.080
No! I won't stop until you stop!

10:00.080 --> 10:03.360
What?! You brat!
You dare to stand up against me?

10:03.910 --> 10:05.240
I've had enough of this!

10:08.890 --> 10:09.800
Remy!

10:13.780 --> 10:15.830
Damn. The dog is disobedient too.

10:15.830 --> 10:16.730
Stop!

10:18.030 --> 10:22.130
Huh! So, you want to go against me no matter what?

10:22.130 --> 10:25.460
I see. Then be sure to remember this! This is the pain of a lashing!

10:31.850 --> 10:35.720
Do you understand!? If you talk back to me, this is what happens!

10:46.690 --> 10:49.060
Heh! You've wasted my time.

10:52.460 --> 10:55.990
Hey Lise, I will tolerate it for today.

10:55.990 --> 10:58.460
But tomorrow you'll sell twice as much!

10:59.240 --> 11:00.650
Do you understand?!

11:37.490 --> 11:40.050
Good. There are more than 20 sous.

11:42.910 --> 11:45.330
I wonder how Lise is doing?

11:54.410 --> 11:55.640
Flowers!

11:56.740 --> 12:00.180
Flowers! Would you like some flowers?

12:00.180 --> 12:01.300
Lise!

12:01.300 --> 12:01.890
Remy!

12:02.450 --> 12:03.910
How's it going? Did you sell any?

12:03.910 --> 12:08.150
Not much... From the morning until now, I've only sold two.

12:10.760 --> 12:11.650
I'll help you.

12:12.970 --> 12:14.520
Have you earned enough already?

12:14.520 --> 12:17.490
Yes, so let's sell these together until the evening.

12:18.070 --> 12:22.250
Thank you. But... How can you be so kind?

12:23.570 --> 12:25.250
Am I kind?

12:25.540 --> 12:29.250
Last night, you protected me. And now today...

12:29.900 --> 12:34.200
It's because I like you, Lise.
And I have a little sister like you.

12:34.200 --> 12:35.170
A little sister?

12:35.170 --> 12:38.310
Yes. She's called Nana.

12:42.000 --> 12:42.810
Let's go

12:42.810 --> 12:44.620
or there'll be no time left.

12:44.620 --> 12:45.730
Okay.

12:47.190 --> 12:50.320
Flowers! Flowers!
Would you like some flowers?

12:50.320 --> 12:52.990
They're very beautiful pansy flowers!

12:53.620 --> 12:56.450
Would you like some beautiful pansy flowers?

12:56.450 --> 12:57.990
Would you like some?

12:59.070 --> 13:02.490
Flowers! Flowers!
Would you like some flowers?

13:03.660 --> 13:04.770
Welcome!

13:18.020 --> 13:19.040
Mattia...

13:19.590 --> 13:23.170
Remy... What should I do?
I haven't sold any of them.

13:23.170 --> 13:24.690
That's a problem.

13:28.730 --> 13:30.770
Yes, I have an idea though.

13:35.200 --> 13:39.780
Would you like some pansy flowers?
Would you like some pretty pansy flowers?

13:42.850 --> 13:46.250
Oh... What a cute monkey! Give me one batch.

13:52.870 --> 13:54.020
You're smart.

13:54.020 --> 13:56.430
All right, I'll take some too. One batch.

13:56.430 --> 13:57.550
Yes. Here you go.

13:57.550 --> 13:58.870
Give me one, too.

13:58.870 --> 13:59.730
Yes.

14:01.850 --> 14:04.870
This is good. They will be sold out very soon this way.

14:04.870 --> 14:07.640
Remy, let's go and try that place too.

14:07.640 --> 14:09.040
Oh... Lise...

14:11.570 --> 14:12.570
Lise!

14:13.960 --> 14:15.150
Are you all right, Lise?

14:17.280 --> 14:19.160
Oh! The flowers are...

14:19.160 --> 14:20.210
Wait!

14:20.700 --> 14:21.720
Mattia!

14:21.720 --> 14:24.260
Won't you even apologize for knocking somebody over?

14:24.260 --> 14:25.650
You ruined the flowers!

14:28.240 --> 14:28.960
Wait!

14:31.190 --> 14:32.570
What are you doing?

14:36.600 --> 14:37.840
Stop!

14:38.410 --> 14:40.340
It's Lise's fault that she didn't pay attention.

14:40.340 --> 14:43.100
But it's no reason to do something like that.

14:46.940 --> 14:48.740
I'm sorry.

14:57.280 --> 14:58.520
Lise...

14:58.520 --> 15:00.280
Remy!

15:00.660 --> 15:04.010
Kids are always treated badly.

15:13.240 --> 15:16.890
What should I do? I can't go home like this.

15:16.890 --> 15:18.220
Leave it to me.

15:18.220 --> 15:19.250
What are you going to do?

15:20.530 --> 15:23.400
Lise, make sure no one's coming.

15:24.670 --> 15:27.750
Mattia, you're not going to do something wrong, are you?

15:28.710 --> 15:32.230
Your job is pick-pocketing or stealing, isn't it? I knew it.

15:32.500 --> 15:35.480
What does it matter!? If we don't bring enough money in, Lise will be beaten!

15:35.670 --> 15:37.230
Pick-pocketing is wrong!

15:37.930 --> 15:41.790
We can work together. Play instruments or sing a song.

15:41.790 --> 15:43.610
Who's going to watch us?

15:43.610 --> 15:46.990
There are still tourists in the park.

15:46.990 --> 15:48.740
Capi and Joli-Coeur can help us.

15:49.160 --> 15:52.170
No one's there anymore. And it'll be dark soon.

15:52.170 --> 15:54.270
Soon it'll start snowing.

15:54.270 --> 15:56.670
No matter the situation, stealing is wrong.

15:57.670 --> 15:58.670
Mattia!

16:02.100 --> 16:03.910
Mattia, you can't!

16:03.910 --> 16:04.830
Get off of me!

16:08.630 --> 16:09.830
Idiot!

16:09.830 --> 16:10.810
But...

16:10.810 --> 16:13.440
If you hate stealing so much, then do what you want.

16:15.740 --> 16:18.360
As you can see, this is it. Sorry, Lise.

16:24.830 --> 16:25.630
Remy...

16:25.630 --> 16:27.910
It'll be all right. We can make it.

16:42.890 --> 16:44.740
Don't cry, Lise.

16:44.740 --> 16:46.040
But...

16:49.340 --> 16:51.100
Here, I'll give this to you.

16:52.180 --> 16:53.210
This is mine.

16:54.780 --> 16:57.620
But then you will be beaten, Remy.

16:57.620 --> 17:00.700
I'll be all right since I'm older.

17:00.700 --> 17:01.510
But...

17:02.100 --> 17:02.880
It's all right.

17:04.370 --> 17:05.560
Is this yours, Lise?

17:06.210 --> 17:07.260
No...

17:11.570 --> 17:13.480
There's about 50 sous.

17:13.480 --> 17:14.810
How come this money is here?

17:38.260 --> 17:41.070
You came back very late.

17:41.490 --> 17:45.240
Sorry... But we got the money.

17:45.240 --> 17:46.070
So does Lise.

17:52.170 --> 17:58.080
Oh... So now you know you can do it if you try hard. You can sit.

18:07.070 --> 18:09.990
Oh... Mattia. I was worrying about you.

18:09.990 --> 18:12.140
It's unusual you coming home so late.

18:12.770 --> 18:15.610
Well how much? How much did you bring in?

18:15.610 --> 18:18.640
Nothing at all. It was an unlucky day.

18:18.980 --> 18:21.840
Huh? Mattia couldn't make any money?

18:21.840 --> 18:23.820
No way. He's lying, right?

18:23.820 --> 18:26.100
It's never happened before.

18:26.100 --> 18:26.820
Yeah...

18:27.340 --> 18:29.780
You mean you didn't even get one sou?

18:30.490 --> 18:34.220
You know what happens if you don't make enough money.

18:34.220 --> 18:36.250
I won't forgive you either.

18:38.710 --> 18:41.040
What's with that face?

18:41.040 --> 18:42.130
Damn you!

18:49.920 --> 18:53.530
Huh! You annoy me.
You really annoy me!

18:54.870 --> 18:55.750
Mattia...

18:55.750 --> 18:57.110
Big brother Mattia...

18:57.110 --> 18:58.090
That cruel-!

18:58.090 --> 18:58.820
Remy!

19:01.950 --> 19:05.820
I've been meaning to change your attitude.

19:06.070 --> 19:09.320
So now, I will beat you thoroughly!

19:11.660 --> 19:12.990
Everybody, go upstairs!

19:18.700 --> 19:20.460
What's with those faces?

19:24.300 --> 19:26.750
Didn't you hear me!?

19:31.910 --> 19:33.220
Go now!

19:36.900 --> 19:38.530
Hey, Remy!

19:51.330 --> 19:52.640
Bastard!

19:58.500 --> 20:01.060
That money has to be big brother Mattia's.

20:01.060 --> 20:04.310
There's no way that big brother Mattia couldn't make any money.

20:04.310 --> 20:07.220
He must've given me the money he earned.

20:07.220 --> 20:08.180
Lise...

20:08.180 --> 20:11.340
Big brother... Big brother Mattia.

20:58.960 --> 21:00.950
That money was yours, wasn't it?

21:02.290 --> 21:03.260
Lise's money.

21:03.260 --> 21:04.230
I don't know.

21:06.040 --> 21:09.700
I'm sorry. You were beaten because of me.

21:10.460 --> 21:12.020
But stealing is still...

21:12.060 --> 21:14.150
I don't want to do it!

21:14.150 --> 21:16.690
But I have to! To survive here, I have to do it.

21:16.690 --> 21:19.410
If I don't bring money home, this is what happens.

21:26.500 --> 21:28.040
Mattia... I...

21:28.040 --> 21:28.990
Go.

21:38.340 --> 21:46.820
Try to love yourself more

21:41.690 --> 21:42.820
Mattia...

21:47.970 --> 21:57.360
Abandoned dreams can be seen again

21:57.540 --> 22:06.040
Surely, not everyone can be so strong

22:07.150 --> 22:17.970
The blue sky lifts all of the world's tears...

22:18.500 --> 22:28.200
Tomorrow's courage comes

22:28.350 --> 22:38.220
From the future that gives us our fate

22:38.360 --> 22:47.020
Try to seek for them more

22:47.940 --> 22:51.690
Give your heart to

22:51.850 --> 23:07.720
That person who is also seeking you

23:21.580 --> 23:23.290
How cute...

23:24.290 --> 23:26.980
You can't keep a cat here. Get rid of it!

23:28.000 --> 23:29.490
Don't you like animals?

23:30.240 --> 23:33.000
If you don't, you won't understand Marcel's feelings.

23:33.070 --> 23:37.040
<i>A kitten on a Rainy Day</i>

23:33.070 --> 23:37.040
Next time:
